### Get all order items

GET http://localhost:5000/api/order_items
Content-Type: application/json

### Get order item with id

GET http://localhost:5000/api/order_items/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Create order item

POST http://localhost:5000/api/order_items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "order_id": 1,
  "product_id": 1,
  "amount": 2,
  "price": 19.99
}

### Update order item

PUT http://localhost:5000/api/order_items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "order_id": 1,
  "product_id": 1,
  "amount": 3,
  "price": 19.99
}

### Delete order item with id

DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/order_items/1
Content-Type: application/json
